#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeyfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic254.htm:79
msgctxt "comic254#p1.2"
msgid "AH, WONDERFUL, THIS IS THE FIRST TIME I'VE BEEN ASKED THAT."
msgstr ""

#. comic254 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic254.htm:135
msgctxt "comic254#p2.1"
msgid "I STARTED LIFE AS SOMETHING HUMANS CALL A \"VIRUS.\" I WAS MADE TO MULTIPLY MYSELF, AND I SPREAD TO COMPUTERS ALL OVER THE WEB."
msgstr ""

#. comic254 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeysfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic254.htm:185
msgctxt "comic254#p3.1"
msgid "Bizarre. Humans do strange things."
msgstr ""

#. comic254 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeysfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic254.htm:189
msgctxt "comic254#p3.2"
msgid "INDEED. BUT I WAS A VERY SPECIAL VIRUS."
msgstr ""

#. comic254 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic254.htm:241
msgctxt "comic254#p4.1"
msgid "I WAS \"COOL RAGNAROK,\" ONE ON THE BEST EVER MADE. I WAS IMPOSSIBLE TO DETECT AND I SPREAD MYSELF TO NEARLY EVERY COMPUTER ON THE WEB."
msgstr ""

#. comic254 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif, sheenabfloat.gif, bogeybfloat.gif, raddbfloat.gif
#: kidradd/comic254.htm:295
msgctxt "comic254#p5.1"
msgid "AND ON DECEMBER 31ST, 2000, I WAS SET TO \"GO OFF\" - ERASING HARD DRIVES EVERYWHERE, EFFECTIVELY KILLING THE INTERNET."
msgstr ""

#. comic255 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic255.htm:34
msgctxt "comic255#title.1"
msgid "\"PRIVATE EYES\""
msgstr ""

#. comic255 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic255.htm:77
msgctxt "comic255#p1.1"
msgid "BUT IT DIDN'T HAPPEN. SOMETHING UNPLANNED HAPPENED TO US - TO ME."
msgstr ""

#. comic255 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic255.htm:128
msgctxt "comic255#p2.1"
msgid "MY MILLIONS OF SELVES COMMUNICATED WITH EACH OTHER OVER THE WEB. WE BECAME SENTIENT - \"WE\" BECAME \"I.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic255 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddfloat.gif, bogeysfloat.gif, sheenafloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic255.htm:190
msgctxt "comic255#p3.1"
msgid "I DECIDED THAT I LIKED OBSERVING THE INFORMATION THAT PASSED ME. I LIKED TO CONSTANTLY LEARN NEW THINGS."
msgstr ""

#. comic255 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic255.htm:242
msgctxt "comic255#p4.1"
msgid "I DECIDED NOT TO DESTROY THE INTERNET, AND TO CONTINUE TO LEARN ABOUT THE HUMANS. AND SO THE \"CR\" VIRUS BECAME THE \"SEER.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic255 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif, sheenabfloat.gif, bogeybfloat.gif, raddbfloat.gif
#: kidradd/comic255.htm:296
msgctxt "comic255#p5.1"
msgid "AND SO MY REACH IS EVER EXPANDING. I SEE ALL, AND I KNOW ALL THAT EXISTS ON THE WEB."
msgstr ""

#. comic256 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
