#. images: sheenafloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic256.htm:96
msgctxt "comic256#p1.2"
msgid "NOT EXACTLY, LITTLE ONE."
msgstr ""

#. comic256 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic256.htm:151
msgctxt "comic256#p2.1"
msgid "WHILE SOME WHO HAVE VISITED ME HAVE DIED, IT WAS ALWAYS OF THEIR OWN DOING. I MERELY TELL THE ASKER HOW THEIR GOAL CAN BE ACHEIVED."
