#. comic256 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic256.htm:197
msgctxt "comic256#p3.1"
msgid "SOME ARE UNABLE TO DO WHAT'S NEEDED TO ACHEIVE THEIR GOALS, AND DIE TRYING. MANY OF THESE GOALS ARE QUITE GREEDY, SO THE RESULT IS ALMOST... KARMIC."
msgstr ""

#. comic256 panel p4
