#. comic259 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: seerright.gif, raddfloat2.gif
#: kidradd/comic259.htm:155
msgctxt "comic259#p2.2"
msgid "Which is?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic259 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic259.htm:206
msgctxt "comic259#p3.1"
msgid "THE TRUE NATURE OF OUR WORLD IS THAT OUR WORLD HAS NO TRUE NATURE."
msgstr ""

#. comic259 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic259.htm:259
msgctxt "comic259#p4.1"
msgid "Great. If I wanted my riddles answered with more riddles, I'd consult a jokebook."
msgstr ""

#. comic259 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic259.htm:263
msgctxt "comic259#p4.2"
msgid "SURE, SPOIL MY FUN."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:51
msgctxt "comic260#title.1"
msgid "\"EYE OF TRUTH\""
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:94
msgctxt "comic260#p1.1"
msgid "THE \"CYBERWORLD\" OF THE WEB IS NOT WHAT IT SEEMS TO YOU. YOU THINK IT HAS RULES."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:153
msgctxt "comic260#p2.1"
msgid "YOU THINK THERE ARE LAWS OF PHYSICS - THAT SOLID OBJECTS AND UNIVERSAL LAWS OF INTERACTION EXIST. BUT THEY DON'T."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:203
msgctxt "comic260#p3.1"
msgid "I'm lost. Quit the Vagueness 101, and give me something specific."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:207
msgctxt "comic260#p3.2"
msgid "VERY WELL. GRAVITY DOESN'T EXIST."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenafloat.gif, bogeysfloat.gif, raddwfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:254
msgctxt "comic260#p4.1"
msgid "No way! I've fallen down pits enough times to know that's not true."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenafloat.gif, bogeysfloat.gif, raddwfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:258
msgctxt "comic260#p4.2"
msgid "BUT IT IS INDEED TRUE. THERE IS NO GRAVITY TO PULL YOU DOWN, YOU FALL DOWN ALL BY YOURSELF."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:311
msgctxt "comic260#p5.1"
msgid "SPRITES' PHYSICS ARE PURELY PERSONAL. YOU FALL NOT BECAUSE THERE IS AN EXTERNAL THING CALLED \"GRAVITY,\" BUT BECAUSE IT'S PART OF YOUR PROGRAMMING TO FALL."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p6
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:356
msgctxt "comic260#p6.1"
msgid "THE CYBERWORLD IS ESSENTIALLY PHYSICSLESS. THE REASON A SHARED PHYSICS SEEMS TO EXIST IS BECAUSE MOST SPRITES HAVE SIMILAR PROGRAMMING - THEY \"FALL\" WHEN THERE IS NOTHING BENEATH THEM."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p7
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:413
msgctxt "comic260#p7.1"
msgid "But... if the rules aren't real..."
msgstr ""

#. comic260 panel p7
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic260.htm:417
msgctxt "comic260#p7.2"
msgid "THEN ANYTHING IS POSSIBLE."
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:36
msgctxt "comic261#title.1"
msgid "\"EYE CAN'T LIE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:79
msgctxt "comic261#p1.1"
msgid "THE MODERATORS HAVE BUILT AN ARMY OF SEEMINGLY STRONG FIGHTERS. THEY'VE SELECTED INDIVIDUALS WITH HIGH ATTACK POWER, DEFENSE AND THE LIKE."
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:138
msgctxt "comic261#p2.1"
msgid "BUT THEY'VE BUILT THEIR ARMY UPON THE FALSE ASSUMPTION OF A \"REAL\" WORLD, WHERE BRUTE FORCE CAN CONQUER ALL. THAT'S THEIR WEAKNESS."
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenafloat.gif, bogeysfloat.gif, raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:188
msgctxt "comic261#p3.1"
msgid "YOU TOO MUST BUILD YOUR OWN ARMY - BUT YOURS NEED NOT BE NEARLY AS LARGE, IF YOU SELECT YOUR CHAMPIONS MORE WISELY THAN THE MODS."
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:240
msgctxt "comic261#p4.1"
msgid "How do we do that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:244
msgctxt "comic261#p4.2"
msgid "FIND EXCEPTIONAL INDIVIDUALS. SEEK UNUSUAL TALENTS; ONES RESISTANT TO ATTACKS OR ABLE TO BREAK \"RULES.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:293
msgctxt "comic261#p5.1"
msgid "You're back to vagueness again."
msgstr ""

#. comic261 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddhfloat.gif, seerleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic261.htm:297
msgctxt "comic261#p5.2"
msgid "NOW, IT WOULDN'T BE MUCH OF AN ADVENTURE IF I TOLD YOU EVERYTHING, WOULD IT?"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:59
msgctxt "comic262#title.1"
msgid "\"UH, I'M OUT OF 'EYE' TITLES\""
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif, sheenabfloat.gif, bogeybfloat.gif, raddbfloat.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:102
msgctxt "comic262#p1.1"
msgid "SO GO NOW - TRAVEL FROM GAME TO GAME, FIND NEW COMRADES, AND WIN YOUR BATTLE. I WISH YOU LUCK."
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: seer.gif, sheenabfloat.gif, bogeybfloat.gif, raddbfloat.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:127
msgctxt "comic262#p1.2"
msgid "Wait! We need to know more!"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: pile.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:226
msgctxt "comic262#p3.1"
msgid "Oh man, that can't be it."
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: pile.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:228
msgctxt "comic262#p3.2"
msgid "I coulda been a stud..."
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: pile.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:230
msgctxt "comic262#p3.3"
msgid "Let's hope we've learned enough to go on."
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:274
msgctxt "comic262#p4.1"
msgid "TELEPORT!"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: pile2.gif, ampmic.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:335
msgctxt "comic262#p5.1"
msgid "Now what?"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: pile2.gif, ampmic.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:339
msgctxt "comic262#p5.2"
msgid "Finally, I was able to get you guys back! We gotta go!"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif, raddwow2.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:387
msgctxt "comic262#p6.1"
msgid "What's the rush?"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p6
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif, raddwow2.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:389
msgctxt "comic262#p6.2"
msgid "The Mods are attacking the Seer's base!"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif, raddwow2.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:391
msgctxt "comic262#p6.3"
msgid "WTF???"
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p7
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddblink2.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:439
msgctxt "comic262#p7.1"
msgid "\"WTF?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p7
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddblink2.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:441
msgctxt "comic262#p7.2"
msgid "It's a human expression. Picked it up in a chatroom."
msgstr ""

#. comic262 panel p7
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddblink2.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic262.htm:443
msgctxt "comic262#p7.3"
msgid "Talk later. We gotta get the F outta here!"
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:51
msgctxt "comic263#title.1"
msgid "\"BACKSTABBERS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: seerspat.gif, ship4.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:91
msgctxt "comic263#p1.1"
msgid "They're insane!"
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, sheenablink.gif, raddback.gif, ampstand2.gif, julie2.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:149
msgctxt "comic263#p2.1"
msgid "Why? Why are they doing this?"
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, sheenablink.gif, raddback.gif, ampstand2.gif, julie2.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:153
msgctxt "comic263#p2.2"
msgid "Maybe Crystal can't afford to have anybody else achieving miraculous goals."
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ship4.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:199
msgctxt "comic263#p3.1"
msgid "There it goes..."
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ship4.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:203
msgctxt "comic263#p3.2"
msgid "Man..."
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:251
msgctxt "comic263#p4.1"
msgid "The Mods are truly ruthless now..."
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:255
msgctxt "comic263#p4.2"
msgid "The only upside to all this is that they were too busy with the Seer to bother attacking <b>us.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddsigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:305
msgctxt "comic263#p5.1"
msgid "Actually, they most likely called for a backup team to destroy us."
msgstr ""

#. comic263 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddsigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic263.htm:309
msgctxt "comic263#p5.2"
msgid "Why do you always wait to mention these things?"
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:35
msgctxt "comic264#title.1"
msgid "\"POP CULTURE REFERENCE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: chase.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:76
msgctxt "comic264#p1.1"
msgid "We've got three Mod cruisers chasing us - They're opening fire!"
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: chase.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:80
msgctxt "comic264#p1.2"
msgid "No choice left, everybody man the guns!"
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatabled2.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:133
msgctxt "comic264#p2.1"
msgid "Oh, I hate violence, but I gotta do this..."
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddtablem3.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:184
msgctxt "comic264#p3.1"
msgid "Alright you Mod creeps, time to rock and roll!"
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeyhalf.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:235
msgctxt "comic264#p4.1"
msgid "Um, I can't reach anything. And most of these controls require, you know... hands."
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ship2.gif, follow.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:283
msgctxt "comic264#p5.1"
msgid "Arrrrgh!"
msgstr ""

#. comic264 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ship2.gif, follow.gif
#: kidradd/comic264.htm:287
msgctxt "comic264#p5.2"
msgid "No, I don't think when Amp designed it he had Bogies in mind."
msgstr ""

#. comic265 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic265.htm:49
msgctxt "comic265#title.1"
msgid "\"FAILSAFE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic265 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic265.htm:92
msgctxt "comic265#p1.1"
msgid "This isn't working! We're getting massacred!"
msgstr ""

#. comic265 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatabled2.gif
#: kidradd/comic265.htm:147
msgctxt "comic265#p2.1"
msgid "Of course we are. They're highly trained and we're completely inexperienced. Our loss is inevitable."
msgstr ""

#. comic265 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddtablem3.gif
#: kidradd/comic265.htm:198
msgctxt "comic265#p3.1"
msgid "Geez Amp, don't you have a secret weapon or something for times like this?"
msgstr ""

#. comic265 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ship2.gif, follow.gif
#: kidradd/comic265.htm:245
msgctxt "comic265#p4.1"
msgid "No, but you can bet I'll have one next time. Assuming we live, of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic265 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ship2.gif, follow.gif
#: kidradd/comic265.htm:249
msgctxt "comic265#p4.2"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:35
msgctxt "comic266#title.1"
msgid "\"PLAYING IT BY EAR\""
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadmad.gif
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:79
msgctxt "comic266#p1.1"
msgid "I'm done messing around! It's time to do this my way!"
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddmrun2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:135
msgctxt "comic266#p2.1"
msgid "Open the rear doors to the cargo bay, now!"
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddmrun2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:139
msgctxt "comic266#p2.2"
msgid "What? Uh, okay..."
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: juliesad2.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:186
msgctxt "comic266#p3.1"
msgid "Oh dear. I hope the boy knows what he's doing."
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: julie.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:239
msgctxt "comic266#p4.1"
msgid "I said, the <b>REAR</b> doors!"
msgstr ""

#. comic266 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: julie.gif, ampstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic266.htm:241
msgctxt "comic266#p4.2"
msgid "I mean, I sure don't know what <b>I'm</b> doing."
msgstr ""

#. comic267 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic267.htm:49
msgctxt "comic267#title.1"
msgid "\"TAKE ON ME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic267 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtablem.gif
#: kidradd/comic267.htm:94
msgctxt "comic267#p1.1"
msgid "Well, I'm taking a gamble on something new. As usual, hmph."
msgstr ""

#. comic267 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: charge.gif
#: kidradd/comic267.htm:148
msgctxt "comic267#p2.1"
msgid "Let's just hope I can hit these guys, and that a fully-charged Mega Radd is enough to do the job."
msgstr ""

#. comic267 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic267.htm:251
msgctxt "comic267#p4.1"
msgid "Wow, it... worked. One guy left..."
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:49
msgctxt "comic268#title.1"
msgid "\"RUNAWAY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:92
msgctxt "comic268#p1.1"
msgid "Huh, the last one's running away. Figures."
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddwalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:150
msgctxt "comic268#p2.1"
msgid "Well, this battle's over, so I guess Sheena and the others will be relieved. Man, what a day it's been."
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought.gif, sheenahug2.gif, juliefglad2.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:198
msgctxt "comic268#p3.1"
msgid "You did it, Radd!"
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought.gif, sheenahug2.gif, juliefglad2.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:202
msgctxt "comic268#p3.2"
msgid "And once again, dumb luck pulls the kid through."
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsleft.gif, sheenaleft.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:250
msgctxt "comic268#p4.1"
msgid "Thanks guys, but if you'll excuse me I hafta, uh, go take care of stuff."
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsleft.gif, sheenaleft.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:254
msgctxt "comic268#p4.2"
msgid "\"Stuff?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeymyell2.gif, sheenafront2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:302
msgctxt "comic268#p5.1"
msgid "You don't have any \"stuff!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: bogeymyell2.gif, sheenafront2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:304
msgctxt "comic268#p5.2"
msgid "He's acting kinda strange."
msgstr ""

#. comic268 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeymyell2.gif, sheenafront2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic268.htm:306
msgctxt "comic268#p5.3"
msgid "A bit more than usual, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:36
msgctxt "comic269#title.1"
msgid "\"REFLECTION\""
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsright.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:77
msgctxt "comic269#p1.1"
msgid "Sigh. I know it was either us or them, but..."
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatright.gif, raddtback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:133
msgctxt "comic269#p2.1"
msgid "Radd, what's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenatright.gif, raddtback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:137
msgctxt "comic269#p2.2"
msgid "Nothing, really. I mean, I was just thinking."
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsfront.gif, sheenastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:189
msgctxt "comic269#p3.1"
msgid "I'm a pretty simple being. I was made with only two abilities: Movement and shooting. That's all. And those abilites point to one purpose:"
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rhead.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:240
msgctxt "comic269#p4.1"
msgid "I, like most game characters, am designed only for killing. And today, like a million times before, I faced enemies and blasted them."
msgstr ""

#. comic269 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddmood.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:295
msgctxt "comic269#p5.1"
msgid "But the difference is: For the first time ever, it wasn't part of a game. Until today, I never killed anybody for real."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:39
msgctxt "comic270#title.1"
msgid "\"WAR\""
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: duotable.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:85
msgctxt "comic270#p1.1"
msgid "I had so much fun blasting things back when it was just a game. Now that it's real, I'm disgusted that I ever enjoyed that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenatright.gif, raddtback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:144
msgctxt "comic270#p2.1"
msgid "Radd, I don't know what to say. Maybe I can't truly sympathize, since my kind are usually incapable of violence."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsfront.gif, sheenastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:191
msgctxt "comic270#p3.1"
msgid "But when Dr. Amp put me behind that gun, for the first time ever I had the ability to harm someone. And it scared me."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheadsad.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:245
msgctxt "comic270#p4.1"
msgid "And... I was secretly glad I didn't have to shoot anybody. Glad that in the end, you did what had to be done. Not me."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenatabled.gif, raddtback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:301
msgctxt "comic270#p5.1"
msgid "And that's wrong too, but it's just our natural tendencies I suppose. Sigh, what am I trying to say?"
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatabled.gif, raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:348
msgctxt "comic270#p6.1"
msgid "I guess we're all gonna be carrying more guilt from now on, if we're really going to make war on the Moderators."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p6
#. slot: imsert images on this line
#. images: sheenatabled.gif, raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:359
msgctxt "comic270#p6.2"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr ""

#. comic270 panel p7
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ship.gif
#: kidradd/comic270.htm:404
msgctxt "comic270#p7.1"
msgid "But we <b>will</b> win, Sheena. Whether we like it or not."
msgstr ""
